$$\begin{aligned}

&\text { We know, for circular plate }\\

&\begin{array}{lll}

& q_u & =1.3 C N_C+\gamma D_f N_q+0.3 B \gamma N_\gamma \\

\text { For sand, } & c & =0 \\

\Rightarrow & q_u & =0.3 \times 1 \times 16.66 \times N_\gamma=1500 \\

\Rightarrow & N_\gamma & =300.12 \simeq 300 \quad \text { (Nearest integer) }

